        <h2 id="高频故障排查与应急急救手册" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-foreground mb-4 tracking-tight">
          高频故障排查与应急急救手册
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6">
          网络连接受阻时，切忌慌乱与盲目卸载软件。遵循标准排障逻辑，能够在数分钟之内迅速定位病因并恢复畅通。
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border/80 bg-background/50">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
